# What goes in /APPS on the disk image (tools/mkhdimg.py; makefile).
# The Apps menu is that folder: each folder is a group. A line per file:
#   <path in /APPS> | <name>       a bundled app: build/extapps/<name>.APP
#   <path in /APPS> | @<target>    a shortcut (.LNK): a built-in app's name,
#                                  an .APP's name, or a path
FileF.LNK                         | @FileF
Settings.LNK                      | @Settings

Accessories/ASMDraw.APP           | asmdraw
Accessories/Calculator.APP        | calculator
Accessories/Calendar.APP          | calendar
Accessories/ClipView.APP          | clipview
Accessories/Clock.APP             | clock
Accessories/TEditor.LNK           | @TEditor

Games/Puzzle.APP                  | puzzle
Games/Sudoku.APP                  | sudoku

Multimedia/Audio Player.APP       | audioplayer

System Tools/ASMTerm.LNK          | @ASMTerm
System Tools/Format Disk.LNK      | @Format Disk
System Tools/HexView.APP          | hexview
System Tools/Monitor.LNK          | @Monitor
System Tools/Print Queue.LNK      | @Print Queue
